    dcterms:description "Monthly heat consumption (heating + hot water, MWh) for 7,033 buildings from 01.2017 to 12.2024, split into annual heating and hot water totals and 5-year averages, plus building characteristics (type, operating year, areas, apartments, floors, volume) and energy certificate info."@en ;
