rea:Dataset_Building_energy_certificates_SCCB_Open_Data_Portal a dcat:Dataset ;
    dcterms:description "Building energy certificates SCCB Open Data Portal: dataset of the REA pilot with 57 variables (Above ground floors, Allowable Ht_aapr, Automation and Control System, Average Indoor Height, Building Energy Efficiency Class, Building External Surface Area and 51 more). The pilot gave no description; this text is derived from its variable list."@en ;
    dcterms:publisher mp:REA ;
    dcterms:title "Building energy certificates SCCB Open Data Portal"@en ;
