rea:Dataset_Buildings_monthly_heat_series_ARCGIS_Server a dcat:Dataset ;
    dcterms:description "Monthly heat consumption updates from 01.2021 to the current month for the 4,845 multi-apartment buildings that don't share a heat generator, pulled from the georiga ArcGIS REST service to extend the historical heating dataset."@en ;
    dcterms:publisher mp:REA ;
    dcterms:title "Buildings monthly heat series - ARCGIS Server"@en ;
    schema:variableMeasured rea:Buildings_monthly_heat_series_ARCGIS_Server__01_2021_current_month_current_year,
        rea:Buildings_monthly_heat_series_ARCGIS_Server__Adrese,
        rea:Buildings_monthly_heat_series_ARCGIS_Server__Kadastra_Nr ;
    skos:note "These are the monthly updates for the heating consumption time series data. | They come from https://georiga.lv/server/rest/services/REA/MapServer/0/query?where=1%3D1&outFields=*&returnGeometry=true&f=json. | It is based on the previous dataset, but the updates are not for every building - they are from the residential multi-apartment that not share heat generator, i.e. the cadastral numbers/building (4845) of https://epuntuagr.sharepoint.com/:x:/r/sites/EnergyGuardConsortium/Document%20Library/5-Work%20Packages%20Working%20Folders/WP4%20-%20EnergyGuard%20TEF%20AI%20Development%20Sandbox%20and%20Integration/T4.5/Buildings%20list%20for%20DT.xlsx?d=w4abad13559c341549c714c7c9ab36303&csf=1&web=1&e=SExlJV. | The updates from georiga sevrer will enrich the dataset, by adding the new monthly value to the historical ones." ;
    eg:storedInDatabaseTable "public.f_tsdata" .

